tools.example:
Application Library: Battery_Design_Module/Lithium-Ion_Batteries,_Performance/li_battery_solid_electrolyte; lib_single_particle uses the single-ion option for a classic SPM.
model.component("comp1").physics().create("liion", "LithiumIonBatteryMPH", "geom1");
model.component("comp1").physics("liion").prop("ElectrolyteType").set("ElectrolyteType", "SingleIonConductor");

Application Library: Battery_Design_Module/Lithium-Ion_Batteries,_Performance/lib_single_particle (Two Electrodes lumped SPM compared with DFN).
model.component("comp1").physics("lb").prop("BatterySettings").set("LumpedBatModel", "TwoElectrodes");
model.component("comp1").physics("lb").prop("BatterySettings").set("Q_host_neg0", "Q_host_neg");
model.component("comp1").physics("lb").prop("BatterySettings").set("Q_host_pos0", "Q_host_pos");
model.component("comp1").physics("lb").feature("vl1").set("J0_neg", "J0_neg");

Application Library: Battery_Design_Module/Lithium-Ion_Batteries,_Performance/lumped_li_battery_parameter_estimation (J0, tau and eta_IR_1C fitted to a drive cycle).
model.component("comp1").physics("lb").feature("vl1").set("eta_ir1C", "eta_IR_1C");
model.component("comp1").physics("lb").feature("vl1").set("J0", "J0");
model.component("comp1").physics("lb").feature("vl1").set("IncludeConcentrationOverpotential", true);
model.component("comp1").physics("lb").feature("vl1").set("tau", "tau");

Application Library: Battery_Design_Module/Thermal_Management/thermal_runaway_propagation (5s4p pack of cylindrical cells).
model.component("comp1").physics("bp").feature("batt").create("te1", "ThermalEvent", 3);
model.component("comp1").physics("bp").feature("batt").feature("te1").set("EventConditionType", "ExplicitTime");
model.component("comp1").physics("bp").feature("batt").feature("te1").set("t_exp", "t_start");
model.component("comp1").physics("bp").feature("batt").feature("te1").setIndex("Qh_te_tab", "Qh_peak", 1, 0);

Application Library: Battery_Design_Module/Lithium-Ion_Batteries,_Performance/lib_single_particle (DFN vs SPMe vs SPM).
model.component("comp1").physics("liion").create("tpce1", "ThinPorousElectrode", 0);
model.component("comp1").physics("liion").feature("tpce1").set("d_pe", "L_neg");
model.component("comp1").physics("liion").feature("tpce1").set("epss", "epss_neg");

Application Library: Battery_Design_Module/Lithium-Ion_Batteries,_Performance/lfp_voltage_hysteresis (lithium metal counter electrode) and Heterogeneous_Models/nmc_electrode_heterogeneous (lithium metal counter electrode; resolved particles use Lithium Insertion kinetics on Internal Electrode Surface).
model.component("comp1").physics("liion").create("es1", "ElectrodeSurface", 0);
model.component("comp1").physics("liion").feature("es1").feature("er1").set("ElectrodeKinetics", "LithiumMetal");

Application Library: Battery_Design_Module/Thermal_Management/li_battery_thermal_3d (C-rate pulses in a subloop).
model.component("comp1").physics("liion").feature("lc1").create("crate1", "CRate", -1);
model.component("comp1").physics("liion").feature("lc1").feature("crate1").set("setVal", "7.5");
model.component("comp1").physics("liion").feature("lc1").feature("crate1").set("tmax", "t_pulse");

Application Library: Battery_Design_Module/Lithium-Ion_Batteries,_Aging_and_Abuse/li_plating (and li_plating_with_deformation for a lithium-metal surface).
model.component("comp1").physics("liion").feature("pce1").setIndex("Species", "LiMetal", 0, 0);
model.component("comp1").physics("liion").feature("pce1").setIndex("Species", "LiDead", 1, 0);
model.component("comp1").physics("liion").feature("pce1").feature("per2").set("ElectrodeKinetics", "ConcentrationDependentKinetics");

Application Library: Battery_Design_Module/Thermal_Management/li_battery_thermal_3d (1D electrochemistry coupled to a 3D cylindrical cell), jelly_roll and prismatic_battery_cooling.
model.component("comp1").multiphysics().create("ech1", "ElectrochemicalHeating", 1);
model.component("comp1").multiphysics("ech1").set("ECHeat_physics", "liion");
model.component("comp1").multiphysics("ech1").set("Heat_physics", "ht");
